{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06754","headline":"岳阳别李十七越宾 · 王昌龄","name":"岳阳别李十七越宾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢楚水寒，舟在洞庭驿。\n具陈江波事，不异沦弃迹。\n杉上秋雨声，悲切蒹葭夕。\n弹琴收余响，来送千里客。\n平明孤帆心，岁晚济代策。\n时在身未充，潇湘不盈画。\n湖小洲渚联，澹淡烟景碧。\n鱼鳖自有性，龟龙无能易。\n谴黜同所安，风土任所适。\n闭门观玄化，携手遗损益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}